      "statement": "Local identities are serialized to `identities.dat` in isolated storage and protected per user with Windows `ProtectedData` on Windows or ASP.NET Data Protection using `dgtp` and `dgtp-Identity` elsewhere; deserialization errors are displayed and yield an empty identity set.",
